sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Feed as FeedPage / Redux
  participant API as postService / Express
  participant Controller as postController
  participant DB as MongoDB
  User->>Feed: open feed / select filter
  Feed->>API: GET /api/posts/feed?cursor=&tag=&tab=
  API->>Controller: protect then getFeed
  Controller->>DB: indexed query + populate author
  DB-->>Feed: posts + next cursor
  User->>Feed: create post with optional image
  Feed->>API: POST /api/posts multipart
  API->>Controller: rate limit + Multer + createPost
  Controller->>DB: save Post
  DB-->>Feed: created post JSON
  User->>Feed: like/comment
  Feed->>API: POST /:id/like or /:id/comment
  API->>DB: update embedded arrays; maybe notify author
